      "user_id": 78624,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766587602200000
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, 88-V-F-7-1-2. Let me just pull that up for you... I see it here, an order for the Aero-Dynamic Helmet. Can I ask what the issue is with the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766587606333333
