      "user_id": 78624,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766587633533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, you absolutely can. Our policy allows for returns up to 90 days on standard items. Since it's well within that window, I've just approved the return and emailed a shipping label to you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766587641399997
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, great. I have the email. That's all I needed. Thanks.",
